"markdown": "# Quarterly Notes\n\n## 1. Introduction\n\nThis report has **bold facts** and *gentle italics* for every example we tried. See the project site for more details and the [full data](https://example.org/data) set, which is well-known.\n\nThings we checked:\n\n- Revenue grew in every region\n- Costs stayed flat\n  - Except for shipping\n- Hiring resumed\n\nSteps to reproduce:\n\n1. Download the data\n2. Run the script\n\n```\ndef total(rows):\n    return sum(r.amount for r in rows)\n```\n\n| Region | Q1 | Q2 |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| North | 120 | 135 |\n| South | 98 | 101 |\n\nThat is all for the first page.\n\n## 2. Two Columns\n\nLeft column starts here and keeps going for a few lines until it reaches the end.\n\nA second left paragraph follows after a gap.\n\nRight column text begins only after the left one is finished being read.\n\nRight side second para closes the page.\n\n## 3. Figures\n\nThe chart above shows growth.\n"
